  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "小卷积核只连接局部邻域；在示例的浅层网络中，相距很远的 x1 与 x7 没有同时接收二者的节点。attention 提供跨 token 的动态信息混合。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "token 是封装信息的神经元向量。通用 tokenization 策略是把输入切块，再把每块投影成向量；课件展示了图像 patch、文本 byte pair 和声音片段。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 11
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "输出 token 的每个代码位置使用同一组标量权重汇聚输入 tokens；W 左乘 T，因此混合 token 轴。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "共享非线性 F_θ 独立作用于每个 token；通常它是 MLP，且这一步本身不跨 token 传递信息。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "token net 交替执行线性 token 混合与逐 token 更新；GNN 的 AGGREGATE/UPDATE 提供对应视角，Transformer 可看作完全图上的 GNN。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 22
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 23
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "与直接学习固定连接矩阵 W 不同，attention 使用由当前输入构造的矩阵 A，因此可依 query 内容动态选择要汇聚的 tokens。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一输入 token 集产生 Q、K、V；QK^T 给出所有 query-key 匹配，缩放并 softmax 后得到 A，再由 AV 汇聚 values。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 33
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k 个 head 分别计算 attention，按同一 token 行拼接成 N×kv 表示，再用 W_MSA 映回 d 维。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "课件图中的 block 依次包含 token norm、MSA、残差加法、token norm、逐 token MLP、残差加法，并重复 L 次。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 38
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "逐 token 层和 attention 都对 token 行置换等变，它们的组合也等变：输入重排会导致输出作同一重排，而非输出保持逐项不变。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 35
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "向 token 代码附加位置，使模型能区分相同内容处于不同坐标的情况。图像示例用多尺度正弦值表示 x、y，并拼接成 p。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 42
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 44
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "causal mask 删除从当前位置通向未来位置的信息边；它允许单次前向同时训练多个 next-token 目标，多层仍保持因果可达性。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 48
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 49
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 52
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "图像编码器以 self-attention 处理视觉 tokens；文本解码器以 causal self-attention 处理文本，并用文本 queries 对图像 keys/values 做 cross-attention。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 54
        }
      ]
    }
